SCOPE — WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES AND DOES NOT COVER

The MIT grant above covers the SOURCE CODE and documentation in this
repository. It does not, and cannot, cover third-party data or figures
derived from it, because those are not the copyright holder's to license:

  * NO VENDOR DATA IS DISTRIBUTED HERE. The research panel is built from
    licensed Sharadar (Nasdaq Data Link) exports, which are gitignored and are
    not present in this repository or in its history. Sharadar's terms are
    personal-use only and forbid commercial use of the data "or any
    derivation". Rebuilding the panel requires your own licence, and that
    licence governs what you may do with the result.

  * RESEARCH ARTIFACTS ARE NOT MIT-LICENSED DATA. Files such as
    BACKTEST_RESULTS.json and the contents of data/free_analysis/ contain
    aggregate statistics computed from licensed vendor data. They are
    published here as a record of what was measured, so that the claims in
    this repository can be checked. Treat them as documentation of a result,
    not as a dataset you have been granted rights to redistribute or use
    commercially.

  * INTERNATIONAL FACTOR DATA (Global Factor Data / JKP), where referenced, is
    CC BY-NC 4.0 — research use only, and it may never ship in a product.

NOT INVESTMENT ADVICE. This software produces model output, not price targets
or recommendations, and nothing in it executes trades or manages money.
